you can download hf's new release 0.7.3

new:
# cw elbug (for mouse and paddle in hfterm,
	also as extra console program "elbug" for paddle only,
	its output can be DTR or RTS of serial port)
# clearer and more user-friendly configuration,
# the "no-mmap" option is now default, means:
	will start in any case, workaround former soundcard problems
# beacon interval now configurable
# autoupdated auto-tools for newer compilers =20
# hftcp, a tcp- remotecontrol - example script included
# fixes in automatic tx/rx, seems more stable.

have fun!

